## Starter architecture patterns

- Event bus + modular packs: core bot emits domain events; feature packs subscribe (XP, onboarding, moderation).  
- Interactions-first: slash commands, components, modals; avoid prefix bloat.  
- Queue workers: offload AI calls to workers (retry, timeouts, rate-limit aware).  
- Config-as-code: JSON/YAML per guild with schema validation and migrations.  
- Observability: request IDs, structured logs, shard health, and slow-event tracing.

